BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 291.89 Td (Q: A client offered me two concert tickets but will not be there. Can I accept?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 277.49 Td (A: Without the host it counts as a gift, so the EUR 50 limit applies. Tickets worth more must be declined.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 255.09 Td (Q: My partner works for one of our suppliers. Is that a problem?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.40 Tf 0.120 0.130 0.150 rg 58.00 240.69 Td (A: Not in itself, but declare it in the HR portal within 30 days so that you are not the one deciding on that) Tj ET
